(7016154, 1061795, 100393, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Blue. A fitting colour. It''s a really nicely balanced image.</td>', 'Congrats on the Blue. A fitting colour. It''s a really nicely balanced image.', '2013-04-08 09:38:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016155, 1061466, 100393, '<td valign="top">Well done on the Yellow. Great light, well-caught.</td>', 'Well done on the Yellow. Great light, well-caught.', '2013-04-08 09:39:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016159, 1061721, 63218, '<td valign="top">A lovely collection of lines &amp; tones. I like the way she is silhouetted against the wall.</td>', 'A lovely collection of lines & tones. I like the way she is silhouetted against the wall.', '2013-04-08 09:42:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016161, 1061932, 138253, '<td valign="top">Thank you guys for the comments. i''m happy with the pic regardless of score or placement, it''s not technically perfect but that wasn''t the intention; this captures who my son is: happy, healthy, bright and a little mischevious and i`m glad to see that resonated with some other people :)</td>', 'Thank you guys for the comments. i''m happy with the pic regardless of score or placement, it''s not technically perfect but that wasn''t the intention; this captures who my son is: happy, healthy, bright and a little mischevious and i`m glad to see that resonated with some other people :)', '2013-04-08 09:43:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016162, 1061734, 63218, '<td valign="top">Made me think of tree bark -- congratulations on the Brown for a very nice image.</td>', 'Made me think of tree bark -- congratulations on the Brown for a very nice image.', '2013-04-08 09:44:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016166, 1061609, 100831, '<td valign="top">I''ll second the don''t ever change part.</td>', 'I''ll second the don''t ever change part.', '2013-04-08 09:49:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016169, 1061787, 93565, '<td valign="top">This is particularly gorgeous. Very good.</td>', 'This is particularly gorgeous. Very good.', '2013-04-08 09:57:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016171, 1061684, 93565, '<td valign="top">Cool shot- Now, the question is... did you wait for an airplane to enter the scene, knowing you wanted that as an ultimate capture, or was it a serendipitous grab?</td>', 'Cool shot- Now, the question is... did you wait for an airplane to enter the scene, knowing you wanted that as an ultimate capture, or was it a serendipitous grab?', '2013-04-08 09:58:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016177, 1060843, 109227, '<td valign="top">What''s this doing here?  Should have finished much higher.  Love it.</td>', 'What''s this doing here?  Should have finished much higher.  Love it.', '2013-04-08 10:10:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016180, 1061159, 43463, '<td valign="top">Congrats on such a wonderful capture - love the beautiful gold tones and mood of this one. The beauty of yesterday wilts away - there is such longing and lingering in this piece.</td>', 'Congrats on such a wonderful capture - love the beautiful gold tones and mood of this one. The beauty of yesterday wilts away - there is such longing and lingering in this piece.', '2013-04-08 10:15:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016203, 1061795, 70661, '<td valign="top">Congrats! Amazing!</td>', 'Congrats! Amazing!', '2013-04-08 10:35:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016207, 1061795, 109387, '<td valign="top">Veeery nice image! Out of curiosity: is it a very generous crop? The moon is really bis considering your focal length on a full frame camera.<br/> <br/>Congrats on a well deserved blue :)</td>', 'Veeery nice image! Out of curiosity: is it a very generous crop? The moon is really bis considering your focal length on a full frame camera. Congrats on a well deserved blue :)', '2013-04-08 10:40:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016212, 1061557, 28276, '<td valign="top">I would agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a>...  The in focus area doesn''t have enough [insert smart photography something here] to hold attention...  There''s just not enough contrast to make it stand out.  Looking at the vote breakdown, no one thought it was bad.  just "meh".</td>', 'I would agree with  Melethia...  The in focus area doesn''t have enough [insert smart photography something here] to hold attention...  There''s just not enough contrast to make it stand out.  Looking at the vote breakdown, no one thought it was bad.  just "meh".', '2013-04-08 10:56:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016232, 1061787, 30861, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is GORGEOUS! True duotone effect even!</td>', 'Oh, this is GORGEOUS! True duotone effect even!', '2013-04-08 11:38:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016249, 1061159, 3936, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image.  I could lose myself for a long time in the detail of the flower.  The tones you''ve chosen work excellently here.  This could almost pass for a full color image as well.  Love the sharpness and the detail, as matched against the bokeh of the background.  I''d certainly hang this on my wall!</td>', 'Fantastic image.  I could lose myself for a long time in the detail of the flower.  The tones you''ve chosen work excellently here.  This could almost pass for a full color image as well.  Love the sharpness and the detail, as matched against the bokeh of the background.  I''d certainly hang this on my wall!', '2013-04-08 12:12:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016267, 1061330, 118154, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top ten,maybe should have been higher but good finish.</td>', 'Congrats on the top ten,maybe should have been higher but good finish.', '2013-04-08 12:57:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016268, 1061466, 118154, '<td valign="top">Yep,Congratulations.</td>', 'Yep,Congratulations.', '2013-04-08 12:58:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016269, 1061147, 118154, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Paul.</td>', 'Congratulations Paul.', '2013-04-08 12:59:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016272, 1060842, 118154, '<td valign="top">Still love this,needed to be higher really.</td>', 'Still love this,needed to be higher really.', '2013-04-08 13:01:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016307, 1061557, 66952, '<td valign="top">On this one, I know what I''m looking at, but it just looks....gooey or something. Not sure how to describe it, but it isn''t really appealing. Again, on this one, I think the toning might have been too strong. My vote got scrubbed, but I think I gave it a 4 or 5.</td>', 'On this one, I know what I''m looking at, but it just looks....gooey or something. Not sure how to describe it, but it isn''t really appealing. Again, on this one, I think the toning might have been too strong. My vote got scrubbed, but I think I gave it a 4 or 5.', '2013-04-08 13:28:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016349, 1060390, 66952, '<td valign="top">Oh, yeah. <br/> <br/>Bird of paradise are fun to work with because of the interesting shapes and colors. This is about as good as it gets. Beautiful line and shape, a B&amp;W conversion that nails the full range of tones, then toning it with just the right amount of brown. Fantastic.</td>', 'Oh, yeah.  Bird of paradise are fun to work with because of the interesting shapes and colors. This is about as good as it gets. Beautiful line and shape, a B&W conversion that nails the full range of tones, then toning it with just the right amount of brown. Fantastic.', '2013-04-08 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016365, 1061563, 100831, '<td valign="top">What no comments! Wonderful glow! Must have been a very clear day.</td>', 'What no comments! Wonderful glow! Must have been a very clear day.', '2013-04-08 15:40:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7016485, 1061577, 30214, '<td valign="top">Great catch, Deb!</td>', 'Great catch, Deb!', '2013-04-08 17:40:52.000000', NULL, 0),
